{"type":"app","meta":{"headers":{"x-nextjs-stale-time":"300","x-nextjs-prerender":"1","x-next-cache-tags":"_N_T_/layout,_N_T_/[...slug]/layout,_N_T_/[...slug]/page,_N_T_/bahrain"},"segmentPaths":["/_tree","/_full","/$c$slug/__PAGE__"],"prefetchHints":{"hints":64,"slots":{"children":{"hints":96,"slots":{"children":{"hints":160,"slots":null}}}}}},"html":"<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charSet=\"utf-8\"/><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/2xf3yuf2jb148.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"script\" fetchPriority=\"low\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/310vm2bl3xxpt.js\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/1f0m_nyksetzr.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/02fh7_m5mrih8.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/1vd1qadx52uao.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/turbopack-3b8en2pv9-gb8.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\" async=\"\" crossorigin=\"\"></script><title>LED Screen Bahrain | 5–10 Day Delivery to Manama | Brightluxx</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"LED screens &amp; video walls delivered to Bahrain in 5–10 days. Fine-pitch for banking, corrosion-protected outdoor for the coast. 2-year warranty with local spares.\"/><link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://brightluxx.com/bahrain\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/0cz1d0mv5g_q7.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><main data-testid=\"next-server-rendered-parity-page\"><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"WebPage\", \"name\": \"LED Screen Bahrain | 5\\u201310 Day Delivery to Manama | Brightluxx\", \"description\": \"LED screens & video walls delivered to Bahrain in 5\\u201310 days. Fine-pitch for banking, corrosion-protected outdoor for the coast. 2-year warranty with local spares.\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/bahrain\", \"publisher\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Home\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"LED Screen Bahrain | 5\\u201310 Day Delivery to Manama | Brightluxx\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com/bahrain\"}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"Organization\", \"@id\": \"https://brightluxx.com/#organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"legalName\": \"Brightluxx LED Displays\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"streetAddress\": \"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\", \"addressLocality\": \"Dubai\", \"addressCountry\": \"AE\"}, \"contactPoint\": {\"@type\": \"ContactPoint\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"contactType\": \"sales\", \"areaServed\": [\"AE\", \"SA\", \"QA\", \"KW\", \"BH\", \"OM\"], \"availableLanguage\": [\"en\", \"ar\"]}}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"LocalBusiness\", \"@id\": \"https://brightluxx.com/#localbusiness\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx LED Displays\", \"image\": \"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"priceRange\": \"AED 2,500 - AED 12,000 per m\\u00b2\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"streetAddress\": \"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\", \"addressLocality\": \"Dubai\", \"addressCountry\": \"AE\"}, \"geo\": {\"@type\": \"GeoCoordinates\", \"latitude\": 24.9857, \"longitude\": 55.0272}, \"openingHoursSpecification\": {\"@type\": \"OpeningHoursSpecification\", \"dayOfWeek\": [\"Monday\", \"Tuesday\", \"Wednesday\", \"Thursday\", \"Friday\", \"Saturday\"], \"opens\": \"09:00\", \"closes\": \"18:00\"}, \"areaServed\": [\"Dubai\", \"Abu Dhabi\", \"United Arab Emirates\", \"Saudi Arabia\", \"Qatar\", \"Kuwait\", \"Bahrain\", \"Oman\"]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How do you deliver LED screens to Bahrain?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Consignments travel by road from Dubai across the King Fahd Causeway or by direct sea freight into Khalifa Bin Salman Port, typically 5 to 10 days door-to-door including GCC customs. Installation is scheduled immediately after delivery.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Do you serve Bahrain's banking and financial sector?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes — fine-pitch LED for lobbies, trading floors and briefing rooms is a core specialism, matching the close-viewing image quality expected in Bahrain Financial Harbour and Diplomatic Area offices. We hold experience with the DIFC financial-district equivalent in Dubai.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How do your screens cope with Bahrain's coastal humidity?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Panels specified for Bahrain use conformal-coated PCBs and corrosion-resistant cabinets to withstand salt-laden coastal air. Outdoor systems carry IP65 protection front and rear with anti-corrosion fasteners and sealed power supplies.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can you support events and exhibitions in Bahrain?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes — rental-spec LED with fast-lock frames and flight-case logistics is available for Bahrain events, exhibitions at BIEC and motorsport hospitality. Crews and equipment mobilise from Dubai within days.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What warranty applies to Bahrain installations?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"The standard 2-year warranty (extendable to 5) applies fully in Bahrain, backed by spare modules left on site and remote diagnostics. Maintenance visits are bundled with our Eastern-Gulf service routes for fast response.\"}}]}</script><div><h1>LED Screen Bahrain | 5–10 Day Delivery to Manama | Brightluxx</h1><p>LED screens &amp; video walls delivered to Bahrain in 5–10 days. Fine-pitch for banking, corrosion-protected outdoor for the coast. 2-year warranty with local spares.</p><h2>Bahrain Areas We Serve</h2><ul><li><strong>Manama CBD &amp; Bahrain Financial Harbour</strong>: Fine-pitch lobby and trading-floor displays for the banking sector.</li><li><strong>Seef District</strong>: Mall retail — City Centre Bahrain and Seef Mall storefront LED.</li><li><strong>Muharraq &amp; Airport</strong>: Aviation-adjacent hospitality and FIDS-style information displays.</li><li><strong>Riffa</strong>: Community retail and showroom signage.</li><li><strong>Bahrain Investment Wharf</strong>: Industrial and logistics operations displays.</li></ul><h2>Bahrain Signage Regulations &amp; Power</h2><h3>Municipalities Affairs Signage Permit</h3><p>Outdoor signage in Bahrain is permitted through the Ministry of Municipalities Affairs — we prepare the structural and photometric file for submission.</p><h3>EWA Power Compliance</h3><p>Systems are configured to Electricity &amp; Water Authority standards with approved loads for larger screens.</p><h3>Coastal Corrosion Specification</h3><p>Manama's salt-laden air demands conformal-coated PCBs, sealed IP65 cabinets and anti-corrosion fasteners — specified as standard on Bahrain projects.</p><h2>LED Display FAQs — Bahrain</h2><h3>How do you deliver LED screens to Bahrain?</h3><p>Consignments travel by road from Dubai across the King Fahd Causeway or by direct sea freight into Khalifa Bin Salman Port, typically 5 to 10 days door-to-door including GCC customs. Installation is scheduled immediately after delivery.</p><h3>Do you serve Bahrain's banking and financial sector?</h3><p>Yes — fine-pitch LED for lobbies, trading floors and briefing rooms is a core specialism, matching the close-viewing image quality expected in Bahrain Financial Harbour and Diplomatic Area offices. We hold experience with the DIFC financial-district equivalent in Dubai.</p><h3>How do your screens cope with Bahrain's coastal humidity?</h3><p>Panels specified for Bahrain use conformal-coated PCBs and corrosion-resistant cabinets to withstand salt-laden coastal air. Outdoor systems carry IP65 protection front and rear with anti-corrosion fasteners and sealed power supplies.</p><h3>Can you support events and exhibitions in Bahrain?</h3><p>Yes — rental-spec LED with fast-lock frames and flight-case logistics is available for Bahrain events, exhibitions at BIEC and motorsport hospitality. Crews and equipment mobilise from Dubai within days.</p><h3>What warranty applies to Bahrain installations?</h3><p>The standard 2-year warranty (extendable to 5) applies fully in Bahrain, backed by spare modules left on site and remote diagnostics. Maintenance visits are bundled with our Eastern-Gulf service routes for fast response.</p></div></main><!--$--><!--/$--><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/310vm2bl3xxpt.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[31262,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"PageViewTracker\\\"]\\n3:I[39756,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n4:I[37457,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n6:I[97367,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"OutletBoundary\\\"]\\n7:\\\"$Sreact.suspense\\\"\\na:I[97367,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"ViewportBoundary\\\"]\\nc