pe\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"GeoCoordinates\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"latitude\\\\\\\": 24.9857, \\\\\\\"longitude\\\\\\\": 55.0272}, \\\\\\\"openingHoursSpecification\\\\\\\": {\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"OpeningHoursSpecification\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"dayOfWeek\\\\\\\": [\\\\\\\"Monday\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Tuesday\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Wednesday\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Thursday\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Friday\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Saturday\\\\\\\"], \\\\\\\"opens\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"09:00\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"closes\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"18:00\\\\\\\"}, \\\\\\\"areaServed\\\\\\\": [\\\\\\\"Dubai\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Abu Dhabi\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"United Arab Emirates\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Saudi Arabia\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Qatar\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Kuwait\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Bahrain\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Oman\\\\\\\"]}\\\"}}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"script\\\",\\\"4\\\",{\\\"type\\\":\\\"application/ld+json\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"$f\\\"}}]],\\\"$L10\\\"]}]\\n11:Tb7f,\\u003ch1\\u003eLED Screen Bahrain | 5–10 Day Delivery to Manama | Brightluxx\\u003c/h1\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eLED screens \\u0026amp; video walls delivered to Bahrain in 5–10 days. Fine-pitch for banking, corrosion-protected outdoor for the coast. 2-year warranty with local spares.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch2\\u003eBahrain Areas We Serve\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\u003cul\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eManama CBD \\u0026amp; Bahrain Financial Harbour\\u003c/strong\\u003e: Fine-pitch lobby and trading-floor displays for the banking sector.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eSeef District\\u003c/strong\\u003e: Mall retail — City Centre Bahrain and Seef Mall storefront LED.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eMuharraq \\u0026amp; Airport\\u003c/strong\\u003e: Aviation-adjacent hospitality and FIDS-style information displays.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eRiffa\\u003c/strong\\u003e: Community retail and showroom signage.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eBahrain Investment Wharf\\u003c/strong\\u003e: Industrial and logistics operations displays.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003c/ul\\u003e\\u003ch2\\u003eBahrain Signage Regulations \\u0026amp; Power\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eMunicipalities Affairs Signage Permit\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eOutdoor signage in Bahrain is permitted through the Ministry of Municipalities Affairs — we prepare the structural and photometric file for submission.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eEWA Power Compliance\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eSystems are configured to Electricity \\u0026amp; Water Authority standards with approved loads for larger screens.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eCoastal Corrosion Specification\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eManama's salt-laden air demands conformal-coated PCBs, sealed IP65 cabinets and anti-corrosion fasteners — specified as standard on Bahrain projects.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch2\\u003eLED Display FAQs — Bahrain\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eHow do you deliver LED screens to Bahrain?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eConsignments travel by road from Dubai across the King Fahd Causeway or by direct sea freight into Khalifa Bin Salman Port, typically 5 to 10 days door-to-door including GCC customs. Installation is scheduled immediately after delivery.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eDo you serve Bahrain's banking and financial sector?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eYes — fine-pitch LED for lobbies, trading floors and briefing rooms is a core specialism, matching the close-viewing image quality expected in Bahrain Financial Harbour and Diplomatic Area offices. We hold experience with the DIFC financial-district equivalent in Dubai.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eHow do your screens cope with Bahrain's coastal humidity?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003ePanels specified for Bahrain use conformal-coated PCBs and corrosion-resistant cabinets to withstand salt-laden coastal air. Outdoor systems carry IP65 protection front and rear with anti-corrosion fasteners and sealed power supplies.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eCan you support events and exhibitions in Bahrain?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eYes — rental-spec LED with fast-lock frames and flight-case logistics is available for Bahrain events, exhibitions at BIEC and motorsport hospitality. Crews and equipment mobilise from Dubai within days.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eWhat warranty applies to Bahrain installations?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThe standard 2-year warranty (extendable to 5) applies fully in Bahrain, backed by spare modules left on site and remote diagnostics. Maintenance visits are bundled with our Eastern-Gulf service routes for fast response.\\u003c/p\\u003e10:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"$11\\\"}}]\\nb:[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"charSet\\\":\\\"utf-8\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"1\\\",{\\\"name\\\":\\\"viewport\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\\\"}]]\\n8:null\\nd:[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"title\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"children\\\":\\\"LED Screen Bahrain | 5–10 Day Delivery to Manama | Brightluxx\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"1\\\",{\\\"name\\\":\\\"description\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"LED screens \\u0026 video walls delivered to Bahrain in 5–10 days. Fine-pitch for banking, corrosion-protected outdoor for the coast. 2-year warranty with local spares.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"link\\\",\\\"2\\\",{\\\"rel\\\":\\\"canonical\\\",\\\"href\\\":\\\"https://brightluxx.com/bahrain\\\"}]]\\n\"])</script></body></html>","rsc":"1:\"$Sreact.fragment\"\n2:I[31262,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\"],\"PageViewTracker\"]\n3:I[39756,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\"],\"default\"]\n4:I[37457,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\"],\"default\"]\n6:I[97367,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\"],\"OutletBoundary\"]\n7:\"$Sreact.suspense\"\na:I[97367,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\"],\"ViewportBoundary\"]\nc:I[97367,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\"],\"MetadataBoundary\"]\ne:I[68027,[\"/