th anti-corrosion fasteners and sealed power supplies.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can you support events and exhibitions in Bahrain?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes — rental-spec LED with fast-lock frames and flight-case logistics is available for Bahrain events, exhibitions at BIEC and motorsport hospitality. Crews and equipment mobilise from Dubai within days.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What warranty applies to Bahrain installations?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"The standard 2-year warranty (extendable to 5) applies fully in Bahrain, backed by spare modules left on site and remote diagnostics. Maintenance visits are bundled with our Eastern-Gulf service routes for fast response.\"}}]}5:[\"$\",\"main\",null,{\"data-testid\":\"next-server-rendered-parity-page\",\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"script\",\"0\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"WebPage\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"LED Screen Bahrain | 5\\\\u201310 Day Delivery to Manama | Brightluxx\\\", \\\"description\\\": \\\"LED screens & video walls delivered to Bahrain in 5\\\\u201310 days. Fine-pitch for banking, corrosion-protected outdoor for the coast. 2-year warranty with local spares.\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/bahrain\\\", \\\"publisher\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"Organization\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Brightluxx\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\", \\\"logo\\\": \\\"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\\\"}}\"}}],[\"$\",\"script\",\"1\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"BreadcrumbList\\\", \\\"itemListElement\\\": [{\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 1, \\\"name\\\": \\\"Home\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\"}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 2, \\\"name\\\": \\\"LED Screen Bahrain | 5\\\\u201310 Day Delivery to Manama | Brightluxx\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/bahrain\\\"}]}\"}}],[\"$\",\"script\",\"2\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"Organization\\\", \\\"@id\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/#organization\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Brightluxx\\\", \\\"legalName\\\": \\\"Brightluxx LED Displays\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\", \\\"logo\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"address\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"PostalAddress\\\", \\\"streetAddress\\\": \\\"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\\\", \\\"addressLocality\\\": \\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"addressCountry\\\": \\\"AE\\\"}, \\\"contactPoint\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ContactPoint\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"contactType\\\": \\\"sales\\\", \\\"areaServed\\\": [\\\"AE\\\", \\\"SA\\\", \\\"QA\\\", \\\"KW\\\", \\\"BH\\\", \\\"OM\\\"], \\\"availableLanguage\\\": [\\\"en\\\", \\\"ar\\\"]}}\"}}],[\"$\",\"script\",\"3\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"LocalBusiness\\\", \\\"@id\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/#localbusiness\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Brightluxx LED Displays\\\", \\\"image\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"priceRange\\\": \\\"AED 2,500 - AED 12,000 per m\\\\u00b2\\\", \\\"address\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"PostalAddress\\\", \\\"streetAddress\\\": \\\"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\\\", \\\"addressLocality\\\": \\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"addressCountry\\\": \\\"AE\\\"}, \\\"geo\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"GeoCoordinates\\\", \\\"latitude\\\": 24.9857, \\\"longitude\\\": 55.0272}, \\\"openingHoursSpecification\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"OpeningHoursSpecification\\\", \\\"dayOfWeek\\\": [\\\"Monday\\\", \\\"Tuesday\\\", \\\"Wednesday\\\", \\\"Thursday\\\", \\\"Friday\\\", \\\"Saturday\\\"], \\\"opens\\\": \\\"09:00\\\", \\\"closes\\\": \\\"18:00\\\"}, \\\"areaServed\\\": [\\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"Abu Dhabi\\\", \\\"United Arab Emirates\\\", \\\"Saudi Arabia\\\", \\\"Qatar\\\", \\\"Kuwait\\\", \\\"Bahrain\\\", \\\"Oman\\\"]}\"}}],[\"$\",\"script\",\"4\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$f\"}}]],\"$L10\"]}]\n11:Tb7f,<h1>LED Screen Bahrain | 5–10 Day Delivery to Manama | Brightluxx</h1><p>LED screens &amp; video walls delivered to Bahrain in 5–10 days. Fine-pitch for banking, corrosion-protected outdoor for the coast. 2-year warranty with local spares.</p><h2>Bahrain Areas We Serve</h2><ul><li><strong>Manama CBD &amp; Bahrain Financial Harbour</strong>: Fine-pitch lobby and trading-floor displays for the banking sector.</li><li><strong>Seef District</strong>: Mall retail — City Centre Bahrain and Seef Mall storefront LED.</li><li><strong>Muharraq &amp; Airport</strong>: Aviation-adjacent hospitality and FIDS-style information displays.</li><li><strong>Riffa</strong>: Community retail and showroom signage.</li><li><strong>Bahrain Investment Wharf</strong>: Industrial and logistics operations displays.</li></ul><h2>Bahrain Signage Regulations &amp; Power</h2><h3>Municipalities Affairs Signage Permit</h3><p>Outdoor signage in Bahrain is permitted through the Ministry of Municipalities Affairs — we prepare the structural and photometric file for submission.</p><h3>EWA Power Compliance</h3><p>Systems are configured to Electricity &amp; Water Authority standards with approved loads for larger screens.</p><h3>Coastal Corrosion Specification</h3><p>Manama's salt-laden air demands conformal-coated PCBs, sealed IP65 cabinets and anti-corrosion fasteners — specified as standard on Bahrain projects.</p><h2>LED Display FAQs — Bahrain</h2><h3>How do you deliver LED screens to Bahrain?</h3><p>Consignments travel by road from Dubai across the King Fahd Causeway or by direct sea freight into Khalifa Bin Salman Port, typically 5 to 10 days door-to-door including GCC customs. Installation is scheduled immediately after delivery.</p><h3>Do you serve Bahrain's banking and financial sector?</h3><p>Yes — fine-pitch LED for lobbies, trading floors and briefing rooms is a core specialism, matching the close-viewing image quality expected in Bahrain Financial Harbour and Diplomatic Area offices. We hold experience with the DIFC financial-district equivalent in Dubai.</p><h3>How do your screens cope with Bahrain's coastal humidity?</h3><p>Panels specified for Bahrain use conformal-coated PCBs and corrosion-resistant cabinets to withstand salt-laden coastal air. Outdoor systems carry IP65 protection front and rear with anti-corrosion fasteners and sealed power supplies.</p><h3>Can you support events and exhibitions in Bahrain?</h3><p>Yes — rental-spec LED with fast-lock frames and flight-case logistics is available for Bahrain events, exhibitions at BIEC and motorsport hospitality. Crews and equipment mobilise from Dubai within days.</p><h3>What warranty applies to Bahrain installations?</h3><p>The standard 2-year warranty (extendable to 5) applies fully in Bahrain, backed by spare modules left on site and remote diagnostics. Maintenance visits are bundled with our Eastern-Gulf service routes for fast response.</p>10:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$11\"}}]\nb:[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"}]]\n8:null\nd:[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"LED Screen Bahrain | 5–10 Day Delivery to Manama | Brightluxx\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"LED screens & video walls delivered to Bahrain in 5–10 days. Fine-pitch for banking, corrosion-protected outdoor for the coast. 2-year warranty with local spares.\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"2\",{\"rel\":\"canonical\",\"href\":\"https://brightluxx.com/bahrain\"}]]\n","segmentData":{"/_tree":":HL[\"/_next/static/chunks/2xf3yuf2jb148.css\",\"style\"]\n0:{\"tree\":{\"name\":\"\",\"param\":null,\"prefetchHints\":4176,\"slots\":{\"children\":{\"name\":\"slug\",\"param\":{\"type\":\"c\",\"key\":\"bahrain\",\"siblings\":[\"products\"]},\"prefetchHints\":4192,\"slots\":{\"children\":{\"name\":\"__PAGE__\",\"param\":null,\"prefetchHints\":4256,\"slots\":null}}}}},\"staleTime\":300,\"buildId\":\"0VevTopRFbkV79u5_PhIJ\"}\n","/_full":"1:\"$Sreact.fragment\"\n2:I[31262,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\"],\"PageViewTracker\"]\n3:I[39756,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\"],\"default\"]\n4:I[37457,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\"],\"default\"]\n6:I[97367,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\"],\"OutletBoundary\"]\n7:\"$Sreact.suspense\"\na:I[97367,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\"],\"ViewportBoundary\"]\nc:I[97367,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\"],\"MetadataBoundary\"]\ne:I[68027,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\"],\"default\",1]\n:HL[\"/_next/static/chunks/2xf3yuf2jb148.css\",\"style\"]\n9:X\n0:{\"P\":null,\"c\":[\"\",\"bahrain\"],\"q\":\"\",\"i\":false,\"f\":[[[\"\",{\"children\":[[\"slug\",\"bahrain\",\"c\",[\"products\"]],{\"children\":[\"__PAGE__\",{},\"$undefined\",\"$undefined\",4608]},\"$undefined\",\"$undefined\",4608]},\"$undefined\",\"$undefined\",4624],[[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"link\",\"0\",{\"rel\":\"stylesheet\",\"href\":\"/_next/static/chunks/2xf3yuf2jb148.css\",\"precedence\":\"next\",\"crossOrigin\":\"$undefined\",\"nonce\":\"$undefined\"}],[\"$\",\"script\",\"script-0\",{\"src\":\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\",\"async\":true,\"nonce\":\"$undefined\"}]],[\"$\",\"html\",null,{\"lang\":\"en\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"body\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L2\",null,{}],[\"$\",\"$L3\",null,{\"parallelRouterKey\":\"children\",\"e